    "created_at": "2021-03-29T19:19:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-29T19:19:47Z",
    "body": "Is there still any interest in adding this?  I have a possible use for it in WebKit.\r\n\r\nIn my opinion, allowing `dictionary mixin` (and `partial dictionary mixin`) seems like a natural way to compose objects, especially since there is no class/`prototype` that's created/exposed for a `dictionary` to the page.  `dictionary` is really just a bag of key->value, so where each of those key->value comes from (whether that be via direct inheritance or some `includes`) isn't really that important.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
